# Where the deployed site lives: the two origins, and nothing else. `npm run build:deploy` reads this.
# The site is static files on SITE_URL. Search, quote checks, MCP and the library's public
# files (cards, text, page images) are all on PUBLIC_API_BASE, called from the browser.
SITE_URL=https://safetypage.noahairmet.com
PUBLIC_API_BASE=https://safetypage-api.noahairmet.com
